'''Gambit Esports''' ''(formerly known as '''Gambit Gaming''')'' is a [[:Category:Russia|Russian]] professional esports organization owned by [[:wikipedia:MTS_(network_provider)|MTS]], a Moscow-based telecommunications company. It was the first [[:Category:CIS|CIS]] team to win a [[Majors|''CS:GO'' Major Championship]], having done so at [[PGL/2017/Krakow|PGL Major Kraków 2017]].

