|content1=
*January 8th - '''Gambit Gaming''' sign [[HS.GG]]. <ref name="HSGG">{{cite web|url=http://gambit.gg/news/official-statements/welcome-gambit-csgo|date=2016-01-08|title=Welcome Gambit CS:GO|publisher='''Gambit Gaming'''|author=[[serginio]]|accessdate=2016-01-08}}</ref>
