*April 18th - [[wayLander]] steps down from the Gambit roster. <ref name="-wayLand">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/n/17593|date=2016-01-08|title=wayLander leaves Gambit|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[MIRAA]]|accessdate=2016-04-18}}</ref>
*April 19th - [[spaze]] joins '''Gambit Gaming'''. <ref name="+spaze">{{cite web|url=http://gambit.gg/news/official-statements/spaze-joins-gambit-csgo|date=2016-04-19|title=spaze joins Gambit CS:GO|publisher='''Gambit Gaming'''|author=[[alexkryvytskyy]]|accessdate=2016-04-19}}</ref>
*June 20th - [[wayLander]] is acquired by [[FlipSid3 Tactics]]. <ref name="wayLandF3">{{cite web|url=http://www.flipsidetactics.com/news/f3-signs-waylander/|date=2016-06-20|title=Gambit and FlipSid3 close deal on wayLander|author=[[MJ Finch]]|publisher=[[FlipSid3 Tactics]]}}</ref>
