*October 2nd - [[hooch]] announces that he has been removed from the team. <ref name="-hooch">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/hoochR/status/782669420372131841|date=2016-10-02|title=Good finish for my time in Gambit|author=[[hooch]]}}</ref>
*October 12th - '''Gambit Gaming''' sign [[Zeus (Ukrainian player)|Zeus]] and acquire [[HObbit]] on a six month-long loan from [[Tengri]]. <ref name="+Zeus">{{cite web|url=http://gambit.gg/news/official-statements/zeus---new-captain-of-gambit-csgo|title=Zeus - new captain of Gambit CS:GO|author=[[alexkryvytskyy]]|publisher='''Gambit Gaming'''|date=2016-10-12}}</ref><ref name="+HObbit (L)">{{cite web|url=http://gambit.gg/news/official-statements/hobbit-joins-gambit-csgo|date=2016-10-12|title=HObbit joins Gambit|author=[[alexkryvytskyy]]}}</ref>.

|content2=
*July 23rd - '''Gambit Esports''' win [[PGL/2017/Krakow|PGL Major Kraków 2017]], defeating [[Immortals]] 2-1 in the grand final.
*August 2nd - '''Gambit Esports''' acquire [[HObbit]] from [[Tengri]]. <ref name="+HObbit">{{cite web|url=https://gambit.gg/news/official-statements/gambit-bought-out-hobbits-contract-from-tengri|date=2017-08-02|title=HObbit officialy joins Gambit|publisher='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>
*August 9th - [[Zeus (Ukrainian player)|Zeus]] and [[kane]] are acquired by [[Natus Vincere]] following internal disagreements. <ref name="-Zeus -kane">{{cite web|url=http://read.navi-gaming.com/en/team_news/zeus_is_back_to_natus_vincere|date=2017-08-09|title=Zeus is back to Natus Vincere G2A!|publisher=[[Natus Vincere]]}}</ref>
*August 15th - '''Gambit Gaming''' add [[fitch]] on trial. <ref name="+fitch (T)">{{cite web|url=https://gambit.gg/news/official-statements/fitch-completes-gambit-csgo-roster|date=2017-08-15|title=Fitch completes Gambit CS:GO roster|publisher='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>
*October 4th - '''Gambit Gaming''' sign [[Andi]] as coach. <ref name="+Andi">{{cite web|url=https://gambit.gg/news/official-statements/andi-to-coach-gambit-csgo|date=2017-10-04|title=Andi to coach Gambit CS:GO|publisher='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>
*November 15th - [[fitch]] is added on a permanent basis.

|content3=
*February 6th - [[seized]] joins the team on trial and [[fitch]] is benched. <ref name="seized in, fitch out">{{cite web|url=https://gambit.gg/news/official-statements/seized-joins-gambit-csgo|date=2018-02-06|title=seized joins Gambit CS:GO|publisher='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>
*May 27th - [[seized]] is benched, [[mir]] is leased from [[Vega Squadron]] for a month. <ref name="seized leaves Gambit">{{cite web|url=https://gambit.gg/news/official-statements/gambit-leases-nikolay-mir-bityukov-from-vega-squadron|title=Gambit leases Nikolay "mir" Bityukov from Vega Squadron|date=2018-05-27|author=[[breakthedeskplz]]|publisher='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>
*June 10th - [[Andi]] resigns from his coaching position. <ref name="Andi leaves Gambit">{{cite web|url=https://gambit.gg/news/official-statements/andrey-andi-prokhorov-resigns-from-gambit-csgo-head-coach-position|title=Andrey "Andi" Prokhorov resigns from Gambit CS:GO head coach position|date=2018-06-10|publisher='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>
*June 29th - '''Gambit Esports''' announce that they have purchased [[mir]]'s contract from [[Vega Squadron]]. <ref name="mir joins gambit">{{cite web|url=https://gambit.gg/news/official-statements/gambit-esports-is-buying-out-mirs-contract-from-vega-squadron|title=Gambit Esports is buying out mir's contract from Vega Squadron|date=2018-06-29|publisher='''Gambit Esports'''|author=[[breakthedeskplz]]}}</ref>
*July 3rd - [[fitch]]'s contract expires and he becomes a free agent. <ref name="free fitch">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/fitchcsgo/status/1014091058907631616|title=Hi all. I’m free agent now. Thanks to @GambitEsports for everything|date=2018-07-03|author=[[fitch]]}}</ref>
*July 24th - [[B1ad3]] is loaned to the team as a coach from [[FlipSid3 Tactics]] till September 30th. <ref name="B1ad3 to Gambit">{{cite web|url=https://gambit.gg/news/official-statements/b1ad3-joins-gambit-csgo-as-coach-on-a-loan-from-flipsid3-tactics|title=B1ad3 joins Gambit CS:GO as coach on a loan from FlipSid3 Tactics|date=2018-07-24|publisher='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>
*September 30th - '''Gambit Esports''' bench [[Hobbit]]. <ref name="hobbit transfer">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/n/24829|title=Gambit open to Hobbit transfer|date=2018-09-18|author=[[Striker (Czech journalist)|Striker]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
*October 7th - [[FlipSid3 Tactics]] and '''Gambit Esports''' agree to extend [[B1ad3]]'s loan until the end of October. <ref name="B1ad3 loan extension">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/n/25018|title=Gambit, FlipSid3 agree B1ad3 loan extension|date=2018-10-07|author=[[MIRAA]]|publisher=[[HLTV]]}}</ref>
*October 16th - '''Gambit Esports''' bench [[AdreN_(Kazakh_player)|AdreN]] and put him on the transfer list. <ref name="AdreN transfer list">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GambitEsports/status/1052267311959293952|title=Gambit Esports announces an opening of transfer negotiations concerning Dauren "AdreN" Kystaubayev|date=2018-10-16|publisher='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>
*November 1st - '''Gambit Esports''' and [[seized]] part ways. <ref name="seized free agent">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GambitEsports/status/1058006174652686337|title=Today seized becomes free agent|date=2018-11-01|author='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>
*November 6th - '''Gambit Esports''' sign [[dimasick]] from [[AVANGAR]]. <ref name="dimasick joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GambitEsports/status/1059740142108323840|title=Dmitry "dimasick" Matvienko joins Gambit CS:GO|author='''Gambit Esports'''|date=2018-11-06}}</ref>
*November 8th - [[Hobbit]] signs for [[HellRaisers]]. <ref name="hobbit leaves">{{cite web|url=http://hellraisers.pro/en/news/5583-hobbit-joins-hellraisers-bondik-is-a-free-agent-now|title=Hobbit Joins HellRaisers. Bondik is a Free Agent now|date=2018-11-08|author=[[HellRaisers]]}}</ref>
*November 13th - '''Gambit Esports''' sign [[Ax1Le]] to complete roster. <ref name="Ax1Le joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GambitEsports/status/1062328768948264960|title=Gambit CS:GO completes roster with 16-year-old Sergey "Ax1Le" Rykhtorov formerly of 5balls|date=2018-11-13|author='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>
*December 1st - '''Gambit Esports''' release [[AdreN (Kazakh player)|AdreN]]. <ref name="AdreN released">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GambitEsports/status/1068910763354542080|title=Today we bid farewell to one of the founding members of Gambit CS:GO as he enters free agency|date=2018-12-01|author='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>
*December 31st - '''Gambit Esports''' sign  [[bondik]] on a 2 month trial, [[dimasick]] is moved to a substitute position. <ref name="bondik joins">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GambitEsports/status/1079769551196295170|title=bondik joins Gambit CS:GO; dimasick moved to substitute position|date=2018-12-31|author='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>

|content4=
*March 17th - '''Gambit Esports''' release [[bondik]] and [[B1ad3]]. <ref name="bondik, blade release">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GambitEsports/status/1107342905033797632|title=Gambit Esports releases bondik and B1ad3 of Gambit CS:GO|date=2019-03-17|author='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>
*May 21st - '''Gambit Esports''' announce that they are putting their main lineup on hold until Fall 2019. As a result, the remainder of their lineup is benched and transfer listed. <ref name="gambit inactive">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GambitEsports/status/1130906519225208832|title=Gambit CS:GO Primary line-up is temporarily put on hold until fall of 2019|date=2019-05-21|author='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>
*June 6th - [[Ax1Le]] is transferred onto [[Gambit Youngsters]]. <ref name="Ax1le moves to Youngsters team">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GambitEsports/status/1136671878788132864?s=19|title=Sergey "Ax1Le" Rykhtorov officially replaces Danil "Porya" Poryadin in Gambit Youngsters|date=2019-06-06|author='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>
