*September 1st - [[dimasick]]'s contract expires and he leaves '''Gambit Esports'''. <ref name="dimasick leaves">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-150395167_8429|title=free agent|date=2019-10-01|author=[[dimasick]]}}</ref>
*December 2nd - '''Gambit Esports''' release [[mou]] and [[Dosia]]. <ref name="mou Dosia free agents">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GambitEsports/status/1201543998516682753|title=Today we bid farewell to mou and Dosia as they enter free agency|date=2019-12-02|author='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>

|content5=
*October 5th - [[Gambit Youngsters]] are promoted to the main team. <ref name="YNG">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GambitEsports/status/1313131859992342528|title=Youngsters no more!|date=2020-10-05|author='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>
*October 10th - [[F_1N]] is moved to an analyst position as a result of his ESIC ban. <ref name="F1N analyst">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GambitEsports/status/1314853179029368837|title=@F_1Ncsgo remains with #GambitCSGO as an analyst|date=2020-10-10|author='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>

|content6=
*February 2nd - [[supra]] is acquired by [[Nordavind]]. <ref name="-supra">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Nordavindgg/status/1356618272658116610|title=We didn't have time to prepare a proper announcement|date=2021-02-02|author=[[Nordavind]]}}</ref>
*August 13th - [[F_1N]] resumes coaching '''Gambit Esports''' following the expiration of his [[ESIC]] ban. <ref name="F1N ban end">{{cite web|url=https://www.dexerto.com/csgo/gambit-reinstate-f_1n-as-coach-following-end-of-esic-ban-1630788/|title=Gambit reinstate F_1N as coach following end of ESIC ban|date=2021-08-13|author=[[MIRAA]]|publisher=[[Dexerto]]}}</ref>

|content7=
*March 16th - [[groove]] leaves his organizational position to focus on coaching. <ref name="-groove sd">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/GambitEsports/status/1504140449388417024|title=Konstantin "groove" Pikiner has left the position of the sporting director of Gambit Esports|date=2022-03-16|author='''Gambit Esports'''}}</ref>
*April 24th - '''Gambit Esports'''<nowiki>'</nowiki> roster is acquired by [[Cloud9]]. <ref name="C9">{{cite web|url=https://cloud9.gg/latest/cloud9-returns-to-counter-strike|date=2022-04-24|title=Cloud9 Returns to Counter-Strike|publisher=[[Cloud9]]}}</ref>
